{"4042470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moon Veil", "steam_appid": 4042470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be part of our community!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/21c7f1ccf3c2e05d934740097969652a.avif?t=1784745000\" width=960 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/0c20983755020fcbb48529224ccf5c14.avif?t=1784745000\" width=786 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moon Veil</i> is a co-op PvP social deduction game for <strong>3–12 players</strong>, where deception, survival, and paranoia collide.  <br>Each match secretly assigns players to hidden roles — villagers, werewolves, and unique special characters. No one knows who to trust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/9b698a82f5a21ce574a7eb12fe36cb16.avif?t=1784745000\" width=786 height=97 /></span>Day Phase – Prepare and Suspect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins at dawn. <br>Players must explore the area, gather loot, and prepare before night falls. Every action matters, because when darkness comes, survival is no longer guaranteed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Night Phase – Hunt or Hide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night arrives, some players transform into <strong>werewolves</strong>. <br>Villagers must hide, run, and survive, while werewolves stalk the darkness. Fear spreads, alliances crack, and suspicion grows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vote Phase – Accuse or Die</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the night, all surviving players gather in the village center. <br>Through <strong>voice chat discussions</strong>, accusations fly and players vote to execute who they believe is a werewolf.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the real werewolf is found, villagers gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the vote is wrong, an innocent villager dies — and the game continues to the next day.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/ab07e24275b40c8fa59ad7bae0727fa6.avif?t=1784745000\" width=786 height=97 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match includes a dynamic mix of roles, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villager</strong> – Gather, survive, and uncover the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheriff</strong> – Investigate and influence votes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Werewolf</strong> – Deceive, hunt, and manipulate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemist</strong> – Can see potion attributes that change each game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of werewolves scales with player count, ensuring balanced tension in every match.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/137d9d9f121a7af20ad99fa652eae4ac.avif?t=1784745000\" width=786 height=97 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice chat is at the core of the experience. <br>Convince others of your innocence, spread doubt, or manipulate the truth — because in <i>Moon Veil</i>, <strong>words can be deadlier than claws</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/512a05d341633d9636a843dedfb00383.avif?t=1784745000\" width=786 height=97 /></span>Villagers win conditions : ↓</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They collect <strong>enough loot during the day</strong> to secure the village before night falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They <strong>successfully identify and eliminate all werewolves through voting</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Werewolves win conditions : ↓</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They gain a <strong>numerical majority in the village before the day ends</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They achieve a <strong>numerical majority during the voting phase</strong>, overpowering the villagers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shifts the balance of power — time, trust, and numbers determine who survives.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be part of our community!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/21c7f1ccf3c2e05d934740097969652a.avif?t=1784745000\" width=960 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/0c20983755020fcbb48529224ccf5c14.avif?t=1784745000\" width=786 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moon Veil</i> is a co-op PvP social deduction game for <strong>3–12 players</strong>, where deception, survival, and paranoia collide.  <br>Each match secretly assigns players to hidden roles — villagers, werewolves, and unique special characters. No one knows who to trust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/9b698a82f5a21ce574a7eb12fe36cb16.avif?t=1784745000\" width=786 height=97 /></span>Day Phase – Prepare and Suspect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins at dawn. <br>Players must explore the area, gather loot, and prepare before night falls. Every action matters, because when darkness comes, survival is no longer guaranteed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Night Phase – Hunt or Hide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night arrives, some players transform into <strong>werewolves</strong>. <br>Villagers must hide, run, and survive, while werewolves stalk the darkness. Fear spreads, alliances crack, and suspicion grows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vote Phase – Accuse or Die</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the night, all surviving players gather in the village center. <br>Through <strong>voice chat discussions</strong>, accusations fly and players vote to execute who they believe is a werewolf.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the real werewolf is found, villagers gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the vote is wrong, an innocent villager dies — and the game continues to the next day.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/ab07e24275b40c8fa59ad7bae0727fa6.avif?t=1784745000\" width=786 height=97 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match includes a dynamic mix of roles, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villager</strong> – Gather, survive, and uncover the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheriff</strong> – Investigate and influence votes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Werewolf</strong> – Deceive, hunt, and manipulate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemist</strong> – Can see potion attributes that change each game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of werewolves scales with player count, ensuring balanced tension in every match.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/137d9d9f121a7af20ad99fa652eae4ac.avif?t=1784745000\" width=786 height=97 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice chat is at the core of the experience. <br>Convince others of your innocence, spread doubt, or manipulate the truth — because in <i>Moon Veil</i>, <strong>words can be deadlier than claws</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/extras/512a05d341633d9636a843dedfb00383.avif?t=1784745000\" width=786 height=97 /></span>Villagers win conditions : ↓</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They collect <strong>enough loot during the day</strong> to secure the village before night falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They <strong>successfully identify and eliminate all werewolves through voting</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Werewolves win conditions : ↓</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They gain a <strong>numerical majority in the village before the day ends</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They achieve a <strong>numerical majority during the voting phase</strong>, overpowering the villagers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shifts the balance of power — time, trust, and numbers determine who survives.</p>", "short_description": "A tense co-op PvP social deduction game for 3–12 players. Loot by day, survive the night, uncover the werewolves — or become one.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/a46d931f480d21c67258d2664277869200fda9ae/header.jpg?t=1784745000", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042470/441f26b5e6013fe1aa5f99d4cc91dfe0da8d03f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784745000", "capsule_imagev5": "h